intermux (2.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * 2.1.0: new main window with tables and inline speed graphs.
  * DNS per interface with custom servers; speed limits; VPN connections from
    the app.
  * Shifted apps keep their DNS, reject IPv6 at once and accept replies under
    strict rp_filter; firewalld trusts each namespace link.

